    <bpmn:process id="W_W5321" name="W5321. Compact &amp; Heavy Equipment Rental Fleet Strategy, Category Mix &amp; Business Case" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Executive decision to enter/expand BuildRight-owned construction-equipment rental (beyond power tools and the W1094 brokerage model)
Frequency: Annual strategy refresh; ad-hoc expansion reviews
Volume: 1 program strategy per year; ~1 category-mix decision per quarter
Owner: COO (rental P&amp;L owner)
Participants: VP Merchandising, CFO, COO, VP Store Operations, Supply Planning
Source: workflow W5321 — Compact &amp; Heavy Equipment Rental Fleet Strategy, Category Mix &amp; Business Case</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5321_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5321_Lane1" name="Rental Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5321_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5321_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5321_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5321_Lane2" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5321_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5321_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5321_Lane3" name="Finance Business Partner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5321_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5321_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5321_Start5" name="Executive decision to enter/expand BuildRight-owned construction-equipment rental (beyond…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5321_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5321_Task6" name="Quantify unmet demand from trade-account and project-quote data (lost sales…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Quantify unmet demand from trade-account and project-quote data (lost sales where customer needed equipment BuildRight did not own — links VS-11/VS-107).
Responsible (R): Rental Category Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5321_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5321_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5321_Task7" name="Build demand model by equipment class (earthmoving, concrete, access/lift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build demand model by equipment class (earthmoving, concrete, access/lift, power/light/compressed-air, compaction) mapped to provincial construction activity and PHP/rental-day revenue.
Responsible (R): Rental Category Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5321_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5321_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5321_Task8" name="Define category mix and store-tier fleet footprint (full-service vs. satellite…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Define category mix and store-tier fleet footprint (full-service vs. satellite vs. hub-and-spoke across 200 stores).
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5321_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5321_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5321_Task9" name="Build business case: capex (PHP 0.5M–8M/unit), utilization hurdle (~60–70%)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Build business case: capex (PHP 0.5M–8M/unit), utilization hurdle (~60–70%), payback, and attach uplift to material sales.
Responsible (R): Finance Business Partner
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5321_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5321_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5321_Task10" name="Present capex envelope and stage-gate to capital committee (per VS-40).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Present capex envelope and stage-gate to capital committee (per VS-40).
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5321_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5321_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5321_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5321_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-02: prevent unauthorized capex — stage-gate approval; CTL-35 (budget adherence vs. approved envelope).
Owner: COO (rental P&amp;L owner)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5321_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5321_Annotation12" targetRef="W5321_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
