Volume: ~60–120 units/yr
Owner: Rental Fleet Manager
Participants: IT/IoT Engineer, Mechanic, Asset Accountant
Source: workflow W5324 — Heavy Equipment Rental Fleet Asset Registration, Tracking &amp; Telematics Provisioning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5324_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5324_Lane1" name="Mechanic">
