Accountable (A): Rental Operations Supervisor
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5326_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5326_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5326_Task9" name="Verify operator competency: valid license/TCO where the class requires it (e.g…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Verify operator competency: valid license/TCO where the class requires it (e.g. heavy-vehicle-restricted units), or issue an in-store competency check + signed acknowledgment.
Responsible (R): HSE Officer
Accountable (A): Rental Operations Supervisor
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5326_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5326_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5326_Task10" name="Capture and store the signed rental agreement, CDW election, and operator…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Capture and store the signed rental agreement, CDW election, and operator certification in the rental customer record (VS-88).
Responsible (R): Rental Counter Staff
Accountable (A): Rental Operations Supervisor
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5326_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5326_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5326_Task11" name="Flag any reject (failed credit, no competency, sanctioned party) and prevent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Flag any reject (failed credit, no competency, sanctioned party) and prevent rental-lifecycle start.
Responsible (R): Rental Operations Supervisor
Accountable (A): Rental Operations Supervisor
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5326_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
