    <bpmn:process id="W_W5327" name="W5327. Heavy Equipment Insurance, Collision Damage Waiver (CDW) &amp; Liability Program Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Fleet intake (W5322) and annual insurance renewal
Frequency: Annual policy renewal; per-unit endorsement on intake
Volume: 1 master policy/yr covering the fleet; ~60–120 unit endorsements/yr
Owner: Risk &amp; Insurance Manager
Participants: CFO, Insurance Broker, Captive (VS-153), Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5327 — Heavy Equipment Insurance, Collision Damage Waiver (CDW) &amp; Liability Program Setup</bpmn:documentation>
