      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5327_Task6" name="Define coverage: physical damage (comprehensive), third-party liability, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define coverage: physical damage (comprehensive), third-party liability, and hired/borrowed operator coverage, sized to unit values (PHP 0.5M–8M).
Responsible (R): Risk &amp; Insurance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5327_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5327_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5327_Task7" name="Structure CDW as an optional customer fee that shifts the deductible/first-loss…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Structure CDW as an optional customer fee that shifts the deductible/first-loss to the renter (per RA 10607 non-life insurance rules / the captive).
Responsible (R): Risk &amp; Insurance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5327_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5327_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5327_Task8" name="Negotiate master policy + premiums with broker/insurer; consider captive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Negotiate master policy + premiums with broker/insurer; consider captive participation (VS-153) for the predictable first-loss layer.
Responsible (R): Insurance Broker
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5327_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5327_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5327_Task9" name="Configure per-rental CDW election and deductible into the rental rate card…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Configure per-rental CDW election and deductible into the rental rate card (W5325) and POS.
Responsible (R): Rental Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Risk &amp; Insurance Manager
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5327_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5327_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5327_Task10" name="Establish claims protocol linking to incident management (W5341) and recovery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Establish claims protocol linking to incident management (W5341) and recovery (W5334).
Responsible (R): Risk &amp; Insurance Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5327_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
